**Given:**

We have to find the simplified value of {13 + [25 ÷ (3 + 7)] - (2 × 6)}

**Concept Used:**

Follow BODMAS rule to solve this question, as per the order given below,

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/0639f45780ad0bd66373ec06a3fb129baeb66e445899e4eaef1dfe7f29dc66e3.png] 

**Calculation:**

{13 + [25 ÷ (3 + 7)] - (2 × 6)}

⇒ {13 + [25 ÷ 10] - 12}

⇒ {13 + 2.5 - 12}

⇒ 3.5

**∴ The required simplified value is 3.5.**

